    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "A meteorologist’s records indicate that it has rained on 30% of the occasions when a particular weather pattern occurred. What is the estimated probability that it will rain the next time the particular weather pattern occurs?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{3}{10}$",
      "worked": "Use the recorded relative frequency to estimate the probability.\n\n$$P(\\text{rain})\\approx\\frac{30}{100}=\\frac{3}{10}.$$",
